{"seq":4,"slug":"compiler-plugins","title":"编译器插件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/compiler-plugins","wordCount":730,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"编译器插件\">编译器插件</h1><p>Kotlin 编译器插件在编译阶段修改或生成代码，是许多框架和工具的核心技术。从 KSP（Kotlin Symbol Processing）到序列化插件，编译器插件让开发者能够消除样板代码、实现代码生成和增强编译时检查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>编译器插件的核心是<strong>在编译阶段介入代码的解析、检查与生成</strong>：它以 Kotlin 编译器的前后端为插入点，自动生成样板代码（如序列化器、<code>no-arg</code> 构造）或增强检查（如 <code>all-open</code>）。KSP 提供了稳定的符号处理接口，使这类代码生成不必依赖编译器内部实现。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"编译器插件概览\">编译器插件概览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[Kotlin 源码] --&gt; B[编译器前端]&#10;    B --&gt; C{编译器插件}&#10;    C --&gt; D[KSP 符号处理]&#10;    C --&gt; E[编译器内置插件]&#10;    C --&gt; F[自定义 IR 插件]&#10;    D --&gt; G[生成代码]&#10;    E --&gt; H[修改 IR]&#10;    F --&gt; H&#10;    G --&gt; I[最终编译产物]&#10;    H --&gt; I\">flowchart LR\n    A[Kotlin 源码] --&gt; B[编译器前端]\n    B --&gt; C{编译器插件}\n    C --&gt; D[KSP 符号处理]\n    C --&gt; E[编译器内置插件]\n    C --&gt; F[自定义 IR 插件]\n    D --&gt; G[生成代码]\n    E --&gt; H[修改 IR]\n    F --&gt; H\n    G --&gt; I[最终编译产物]\n    H --&gt; I</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>插件类型</th>\n<th>作用时机</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>典型示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>KSP</td>\n<td>编译前（符号处理）</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>Room、Moshi、Koin 注解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Gradle 编译器插件</td>\n<td>编译中（IR 变换）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>all-open、no-arg、serialization</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义编译器插件</td>\n<td>编译中（IR 变换）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>Compose 编译器</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ksp-kotlin-symbol-processing\">KSP（Kotlin Symbol Processing）</h2><p>KSP 是 Google 开发的轻量级符号处理框架，替代了 Java 的 KAPT（Kotlin Annotation Processing Tool）：</p>\n<h3 id=\"ksp-vs-kapt\">KSP vs KAPT</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>KAPT</th>\n<th>KSP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础</td>\n<td>Java APT，需要 stub 生成</td>\n<td>原生 Kotlin 编译器 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>速度</td>\n<td>慢（2 次编译）</td>\n<td>快（最多 2 倍提升）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支持 KMP</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>增量处理</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>更好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>访问 Kotlin 特性</td>\n<td>有限</td>\n<td>完整（suspend、sealed 等）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"ksp-处理器示例\">KSP 处理器示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    id(&quot;com.google.devtools.ksp&quot;) version &quot;1.9.20-1.0.14&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;dependencies {&#10;    ksp(&quot;com.example:my-processor:1.0&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    id(\"com.google.devtools.ksp\") version \"1.9.20-1.0.14\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ksp(\"com.example:my-processor:1.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一个简单的 KSP 处理器结构：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"class MyProcessor(&#10;    private val codeGenerator: CodeGenerator,&#10;    private val logger: KSPLogger&#10;) : SymbolProcessor {&#10;&#10;    override fun process(resolver: Resolver): List&lt;KSAnnotated&gt; {&#10;        val symbols = resolver.getSymbolsWithAnnotation(&quot;com.example.AutoFactory&quot;)&#10;            .filterIsInstance&lt;KSClassDeclaration&gt;()&#10;&#10;        symbols.forEach { classDecl -&gt;&#10;            generateFactory(classDecl)&#10;        }&#10;&#10;        return emptyList() // 返回未处理的符号（下一轮再处理）&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    private fun generateFactory(classDecl: KSClassDeclaration) {&#10;        val packageName = classDecl.packageName.asString()&#10;        val className = classDecl.simpleName.asString()&#10;&#10;        val file = codeGenerator.createNewFile(&#10;            Dependencies(true, classDecl.containingFile!!),&#10;            packageName,&#10;            &quot;${className}Factory&quot;&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        file.writer().use { writer -&gt;&#10;            writer.write(&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;                package $packageName&#10;&#10;                object ${className}Factory {&#10;                    fun create(): $className = $className()&#10;                }&#10;            &quot;&quot;&quot;.trimIndent())&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;class MyProcessorProvider : SymbolProcessorProvider {&#10;    override fun create(environment: SymbolProcessorEnvironment): SymbolProcessor {&#10;        return MyProcessor(environment.codeGenerator, environment.logger)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class MyProcessor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val codeGenerator: CodeGenerator,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val logger: KSPLogger</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : SymbolProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun process(resolver: Resolver): List&#x3C;KSAnnotated> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val symbols = resolver.getSymbolsWithAnnotation(\"com.example.AutoFactory\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .filterIsInstance&#x3C;KSClassDeclaration>()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        symbols.forEach { classDecl -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            generateFactory(classDecl)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return emptyList() // 返回未处理的符号（下一轮再处理）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private fun generateFactory(classDecl: KSClassDeclaration) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val packageName = classDecl.packageName.asString()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val className = classDecl.simpleName.asString()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val file = codeGenerator.createNewFile(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Dependencies(true, classDecl.containingFile!!),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            packageName,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"${className}Factory\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        file.writer().use { writer -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            writer.write(\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                package $packageName</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                object ${className}Factory {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    fun create(): $className = $className()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"\"\".trimIndent())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MyProcessorProvider : SymbolProcessorProvider {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun create(environment: SymbolProcessorEnvironment): SymbolProcessor {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return MyProcessor(environment.codeGenerator, environment.logger)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> KSP 处理器需要在 <code>META-INF/services/com.google.devtools.ksp.processing.SymbolProcessorProvider</code> 中注册。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"all-open-插件\">all-open 插件</h2><p><code>all-open</code> 插件自动为标注了特定注解的类添加 <code>open</code> 修饰符。Spring 框架需要 CGLIB 代理，而 Kotlin 类默认是 <code>final</code> 的：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    kotlin(&quot;plugin.allopen&quot;) version &quot;1.9.20&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;allOpen {&#10;    annotation(&quot;org.springframework.stereotype.Service&quot;)&#10;    annotation(&quot;org.springframework.stereotype.Component&quot;)&#10;    annotation(&quot;org.springframework.transaction.annotation.Transactional&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"plugin.allopen\") version \"1.9.20\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allOpen {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    annotation(\"org.springframework.stereotype.Service\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    annotation(\"org.springframework.stereotype.Component\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    annotation(\"org.springframework.transaction.annotation.Transactional\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Service // 编译后自动变为 open&#10;class UserService {&#10;    // 所有方法也自动变为 open&#10;    fun findUser(id: Long): User? = repository.findById(id)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Service // 编译后自动变为 open</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 所有方法也自动变为 open</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun findUser(id: Long): User? = repository.findById(id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;@Service class UserService&quot;] --&gt;|all-open 插件| B[&quot;open class UserService&quot;]&#10;    C[&quot;fun findUser()&quot;] --&gt;|自动| D[&quot;open fun findUser()&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"@Service class UserService\"] --&gt;|all-open 插件| B[\"open class UserService\"]\n    C[\"fun findUser()\"] --&gt;|自动| D[\"open fun findUser()\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"no-arg-插件\">no-arg 插件</h2><p><code>no-arg</code> 插件为标注了特定注解的类生成无参构造函数。JPA 实体需要无参构造函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    kotlin(&quot;plugin.noarg&quot;) version &quot;1.9.20&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;noArg {&#10;    annotation(&quot;jakarta.persistence.Entity&quot;)&#10;    invokeInitializers = true // 调用 init 块&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"plugin.noarg\") version \"1.9.20\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>noArg {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    annotation(\"jakarta.persistence.Entity\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    invokeInitializers = true // 调用 init 块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Entity&#10;data class User(&#10;    @Id val id: Long,&#10;    val name: String,&#10;    val email: String&#10;)&#10;// 编译后自动生成 User() 无参构造函数&#10;// 源码中不可见，但反射和 JPA 可以使用\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class User(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Id val id: Long,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val email: String</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 编译后自动生成 User() 无参构造函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 源码中不可见，但反射和 JPA 可以使用</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"kotlin-serialization-插件\">kotlin-serialization 插件</h2><p>序列化插件是最广泛使用的 Kotlin 编译器插件，为 <code>@Serializable</code> 类自动生成序列化器：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// build.gradle.kts&#10;plugins {&#10;    kotlin(&quot;plugin.serialization&quot;) version &quot;1.9.20&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;dependencies {&#10;    implementation(&quot;org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json:1.6.0&quot;)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// build.gradle.kts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>plugins {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    kotlin(\"plugin.serialization\") version \"1.9.20\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>dependencies {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    implementation(\"org.jetbrains.kotlinx:kotlinx-serialization-json:1.6.0\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"import kotlinx.serialization.*&#10;import kotlinx.serialization.json.*&#10;&#10;@Serializable&#10;data class User(&#10;    val id: Long,&#10;    val name: String,&#10;    @SerialName(&quot;email_address&quot;)&#10;    val email: String,&#10;    val roles: List&lt;String&gt; = emptyList()&#10;)&#10;&#10;val json = Json { prettyPrint = true }&#10;val user = User(1, &quot;张三&quot;, &quot;zhangsan@example.com&quot;, listOf(&quot;admin&quot;))&#10;&#10;val jsonString = json.encodeToString(user)&#10;val decoded = json.decodeFromString&lt;User&gt;(jsonString)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.serialization.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import kotlinx.serialization.json.*</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Serializable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class User(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val id: Long,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val name: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @SerialName(\"email_address\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val email: String,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val roles: List&#x3C;String> = emptyList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val json = Json { prettyPrint = true }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val user = User(1, \"张三\", \"zhangsan@example.com\", listOf(\"admin\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val jsonString = json.encodeToString(user)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>val decoded = json.decodeFromString&#x3C;User>(jsonString)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>插件在编译时生成的内容：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>生成的代码</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>User.serializer()</code></td>\n<td>返回类型安全的序列化器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>User.$serializer</code></td>\n<td>内部序列化实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>User.Companion</code> 扩展</td>\n<td><code>serializer()</code> 伴随对象方法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义编译器插件基础\">自定义编译器插件基础</h2><p>自定义编译器插件开发涉及 Kotlin 编译器的 IR（Intermediate Representation）层：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// 插件注册&#10;class MyCompilerPlugin : CompilerPluginRegistrar() {&#10;    override val supportsK2: Boolean = true&#10;&#10;    override fun ExtensionStorage.registerExtensions(configuration: CompilerConfiguration) {&#10;        IrGenerationExtension.registerExtension(MyIrExtension())&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// IR 变换&#10;class MyIrExtension : IrGenerationExtension {&#10;    override fun generate(moduleFragment: IrModuleFragment, pluginContext: IrPluginContext) {&#10;        moduleFragment.transformChildrenVoid(object : IrElementTransformerVoid() {&#10;            override fun visitFunction(declaration: IrFunction): IrStatement {&#10;                // 在此处修改函数的 IR&#10;                return super.visitFunction(declaration)&#10;            }&#10;        })&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 插件注册</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MyCompilerPlugin : CompilerPluginRegistrar() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override val supportsK2: Boolean = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun ExtensionStorage.registerExtensions(configuration: CompilerConfiguration) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        IrGenerationExtension.registerExtension(MyIrExtension())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// IR 变换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class MyIrExtension : IrGenerationExtension {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun generate(moduleFragment: IrModuleFragment, pluginContext: IrPluginContext) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        moduleFragment.transformChildrenVoid(object : IrElementTransformerVoid() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            override fun visitFunction(declaration: IrFunction): IrStatement {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                // 在此处修改函数的 IR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                return super.visitFunction(declaration)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 自定义编译器插件开发门槛较高，需要深入理解 Kotlin IR。对于大多数代码生成需求，KSP 是更好的选择。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"插件选择指南\">插件选择指南</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[需要编译时处理?] --&gt; B{需求类型?}&#10;    B --&gt;|从注解生成代码| C[KSP]&#10;    B --&gt;|修改类的 open/构造函数| D[all-open / no-arg]&#10;    B --&gt;|序列化支持| E[serialization 插件]&#10;    B --&gt;|深度修改编译行为| F[自定义编译器插件]&#10;    C --&gt; G[推荐:最简单、最灵活]&#10;    F --&gt; H[高级:需要 IR 知识]\">flowchart TD\n    A[需要编译时处理?] --&gt; B{需求类型?}\n    B --&gt;|从注解生成代码| C[KSP]\n    B --&gt;|修改类的 open/构造函数| D[all-open / no-arg]\n    B --&gt;|序列化支持| E[serialization 插件]\n    B --&gt;|深度修改编译行为| F[自定义编译器插件]\n    C --&gt; G[推荐:最简单、最灵活]\n    F --&gt; H[高级:需要 IR 知识]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>KSP</strong> 是轻量级的 Kotlin 符号处理器，比 KAPT 更快且支持 KMP</li>\n<li><strong>all-open</strong> 插件为标注注解的类自动添加 <code>open</code>，解决 Spring 代理需求</li>\n<li><strong>no-arg</strong> 插件为标注注解的类生成无参构造函数，满足 JPA 需求</li>\n<li><strong>kotlin-serialization</strong> 插件为 <code>@Serializable</code> 类自动生成序列化器</li>\n<li>自定义编译器插件通过 IR 变换实现深度编译行为修改，开发门槛较高</li>\n<li>优先选择 KSP 进行代码生成，只有在需要修改编译行为时才考虑自定义编译器插件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"编译器插件","id":"编译器插件"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"编译器插件概览","id":"编译器插件概览"},{"level":2,"text":"KSP（Kotlin Symbol Processing）","id":"ksp-kotlin-symbol-processing"},{"level":3,"text":"KSP vs KAPT","id":"ksp-vs-kapt"},{"level":3,"text":"KSP 处理器示例","id":"ksp-处理器示例"},{"level":2,"text":"all-open 插件","id":"all-open-插件"},{"level":2,"text":"no-arg 插件","id":"no-arg-插件"},{"level":2,"text":"kotlin-serialization 插件","id":"kotlin-serialization-插件"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义编译器插件基础","id":"自定义编译器插件基础"},{"level":2,"text":"插件选择指南","id":"插件选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"上下文接收者","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/advanced-features/context-receivers"},"next":{"title":"空安全模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/kotlin-advanced/idioms-and-best-practices/null-safety-patterns"}}